_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6ev7xdKAfogQ7kNvwFIaA4w&_nc_oc=AdpfMvaCFqQ9ZJfn7vgyUlkP012kI5i0huhfFVYp5IWrhWCL8CJiHT-4ow0BBRyC1KI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRkZAeo22IYbjvR8EwYs1QddNzPExO908uHb1yA8VmVDQ&oe=6B08705B"}, "display_name": "The Show VR - Multiplayer Minigames", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Enter the world of minigames in VR!\n\n*First of a kind multiplayer game that allows you to be part of The Show!*\n\nThis is a pre-alpha version of the game, please give us feedback. our site - www.theshowvr.com\n\nOur Current Minigames:\n\n- **Green Light, Red Light**: Test your reflexes and strategy in this classic stop-and-go game.\n\n- **Snowball Fight**: Engage in epic snowball battles with realistic physics for an immersive experience.\n\n- **Falling Stones**: Dodge the falling obstacles and be the last one standing.\n\n- **Sky Fall**: Navigate through the skies and avoid obstacles in this aerial challenge.\n\n- **Green Mountain Obstacle Course**: Race against others in a thrilling obstacle course set on a treacherous green mountain.\n\n- **Bomb Tag**: Pass the bomb to other players to avoid getting blown up in this fast-paced game of tag.\n\n- **Stepping Glass**: Carefully step on the correct glass tiles without falling through in this nerve-wracking challenge.\n\n- **The Wall**: Are you ready to climb? Be the first to reach the top!\n\n**Minimum 2 players are required to start a match, please give us any feedback on discord & our site at www.theshowvr.com**\n\nOur goal is to make the funniest community multiplayer minigames game on VR :)\n\nThank you for trying out the game at an early stage!", "short_description": "Welcome to The Show VR, a unique multiplayer game that brings you and up to 15 other players into a world of fun minigames! Inspired by the best minigames in shows/games!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.theshowvr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_term